00:39:40.050 --> 00:39:40.550
server.

00:39:40.550 --> 00:39:45.880
So I'm going to a website now.

00:39:45.880 --> 00:39:49.383
The website is an
RStudio Connect server.

00:39:49.383 --> 00:39:51.550
When I get to the website,
I can see all the content

00:39:51.550 --> 00:39:53.650
I've posted on RStudio Connect.

00:39:53.650 --> 00:39:56.380
And the thing that I posted on
there for days is called 03 rmd

00:39:56.380 --> 00:39:57.140
with parameters.

00:39:57.140 --> 00:39:58.600
It's a file that's in--

00:39:58.600 --> 00:40:00.310
I have materials for today.

00:40:00.310 --> 00:40:02.200
And if I click on it,
I could see the file.

00:40:02.200 --> 00:40:03.790
It's the same file
we've been looking at.

00:40:03.790 --> 00:40:05.165
And I could send
this to my boss.

00:40:05.165 --> 00:40:07.653
I could send this to the
president or to Tariff.

00:40:07.653 --> 00:40:09.070
You could click
on the file, he'll

00:40:09.070 --> 00:40:10.540
