00:40:18.520 --> 00:40:21.940
and he can choose his drug here.

00:40:21.940 --> 00:40:23.710
Aspirin.

00:40:23.710 --> 00:40:25.570
And he could run the report.

00:40:25.570 --> 00:40:27.880
The code that I
wrote for this report

00:40:27.880 --> 00:40:31.870
is now being executed by RStudio
Connect on a server somewhere.

00:40:31.870 --> 00:40:33.800
It doesn't matter that
I have R on computer.

00:40:33.800 --> 00:40:36.140
That's just-- because I need it.

00:40:36.140 --> 00:40:37.310
But you could go here.

00:40:37.310 --> 00:40:38.560
And if you had access
to this document,

00:40:38.560 --> 00:40:40.630
you could run this without
