00:40:47.110 --> 00:40:48.760
it'd be very easy
for me to do things

00:40:48.760 --> 00:40:51.160
like schedule it to be updated.

00:40:51.160 --> 00:40:53.740
Whenever I know that the data
itself is getting updated,

00:40:53.740 --> 00:40:56.170
it would be very easy for
me to update this report

00:40:56.170 --> 00:40:59.230
and automatically email
