00:40:59.230 --> 00:41:01.270
every Monday or Tuesday.

00:41:01.270 --> 00:41:03.550
Then it'd be very easy to
see how people have been

00:41:03.550 --> 00:41:06.160
interacting with this report
or how this report has changed

00:41:06.160 --> 00:41:08.410
over time, perhaps, by
looking at the version

00:41:08.410 --> 00:41:10.840
history or something else here.

