00:41:49.840 --> 00:41:52.210
I'm not aware of
that research, Steve.

00:41:52.210 --> 00:41:54.580
I think Computational
Documents are sort of

00:41:54.580 --> 00:41:56.900
in the early adoption phase.

00:41:56.900 --> 00:41:59.410
It does also depend
on how liberally you

00:41:59.410 --> 00:42:01.940
want to define
Computational Documents.

00:42:01.940 --> 00:42:06.895
But what I have seen anecdotally
is that adoption is spreading.

00:42:06.895 --> 00:42:09.020
So the percent of data
scientist using these things

00:42:09.020 --> 00:42:11.370
will be increasing.

00:42:11.370 --> 00:42:13.710
Will pagedown be covered in
